    'hviid2019': ['Hviid, Hansen, Frisch and Melbye: Measles, Mumps, Rubella Vaccination and Autism, a Nationwide Cohort Study, Annals of Internal Medicine (2019)', 'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30831578/'],
