    'pew-guns': ['Pew Research Center: What the Data Says About Gun Deaths in the U.S. (updated 2026, CDC and FBI data)', 'https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2023/04/26/what-the-data-says-about-gun-deaths-in-the-u-s/'],
